{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_4_001_10_j",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:acd9bdebd0b67d2ca39a3ffe0b4d38a41f02323688a0578b452d159916f2f27a",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_j:cmd-000027:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c5b3b50c0b92b38de45cd836ee61efba01412178d007f973161a59975d4c7544",
      "text": "JIF结束后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_j:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2a7b5e2df9ebce317d937e9b2715112ea46d2b142f3b3dabcf80f6383ec1af12",
      "text": "啊～已经精疲力竭了……\n剩下的体力只够走去冲个澡了啦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_j:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a773f3e0e01354b28c25feb338628f007f929d414b8d70a454671292a2ea3594",
      "text": "淋浴间也得排队呢。\n看来还要花不少时间，先擦擦汗等着吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_j:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:244b8a2dd556e120eda5cf080eee8b8d0190de68144f5e3975f02a01d6ddeb17",
      "text": "好—的。\n冬马君，帮我拿一下毛巾～。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_j:cmd-000078:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:75ea5e7dda130938baf09c920d1d1cf18cec6f589790f4b37ba67d34122f643c",
      "text": "拿你没办法。……嗯？这是什么？\n是封信啊。喂，你们两个看一下这个。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_j:cmd-000099:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:962bfd9834f255576129a3fb2efe31d57a9f67fb4e75cacf7e9dfc0fb075dfde",
      "text": "说是给Jupiter大人。\n看起来是给我们的，是什么呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_j:cmd-000108:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:31362565fe000581c75bff0eb23435c224df40eff27e4f2bd4f389758ecb58ac",
      "text": "看起来……不像粉丝信呢。\n打开来看看吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_j:cmd-000123:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ed4c819cf3ccb022108f0de282ce88c4481a42fdaa88b78a3ebd054e72a5e82c",
      "text": "场馆走廊",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_j:cmd-000130:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:43ce38dfdfb2cbbb5abc4c652732a953911a9a8d020d9d8a6a01aece5a17699f",
      "text": "快点啦，悠介！赶紧去冲澡了。\n后面还有人在等呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_j:cmd-000144:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bb9b6b2f0d91530b5644a5dc982eef6a9c1ec9897b0adf99bdabf9cacaf37553",
      "text": "等等我嘛。我总觉得\n整个人轻飘飘的……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_j:cmd-000160:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:02327624f08eeaca019b4249e41eadad663de5c7bfc0a860686f32a7138eba12",
      "text": "喂，你们几个。\n……是315 Production的W吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_j:cmd-000163:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:698bceb8b2cde22b3e18c7997b79111a01188443db7d58daa8772fe9dfeca06c",
      "text": "诶？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_j:cmd-000166:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d5d46240ba21ecc0703d411071095108fec862a6d832ef341186f10a2aef27d7",
      "text": "是这样没错，但……？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_j:cmd-000170:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:de63b71d36693fe8d360239634476b1d84cc4b4448863429a2d4b783424ebbd1",
      "text": "你们也要参加“男极”吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_j:cmd-000178:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6ce234e945da23b5bfd97336ae96c8be45f5afae284d84860c014dc829815b1b",
      "text": "……“男极”？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_j:cmd-000192:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7823f8c3b6be94411f17c1968ba69b64e83c516fdefe2ddece84d5a8321a6435",
      "text": "当天夜晚……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_j:cmd-000204:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e933e8fce9a304382644c7a9a853aae1f8db66c9df11f345e0d4e78f03a3d1ed",
      "text": "啊，●●●●●●●●●●监督！\n辛苦啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_j:cmd-000206:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:abb06b369d56b95a1a5ed94fe7d05781c4053070b626f5332d7ba0b90d62e8b9",
      "text": "今天的Live真厉害呢。\n我到现在心跳都还在扑通扑通跳个不停呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_j:cmd-000208:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bfef5e8ecef1279c3f9aee584654169232de49d7ea95a6c88358fe1d1bfb09a5",
      "text": "不过，Live结束后发生了一件奇怪的事。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_j:cmd-000210:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:94cf5d793b8cd6c439f37220cd6d5ecaebfac509a3e22e8d9219e769a6005098",
      "text": "回休息室的时候，被其他事务所的\n偶像搭话了……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_j:cmd-000212:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b9c2267186e525977378a677c87a3159faf208f45ed12ad7cb610c82597eb024",
      "text": "是其他事务所的\n偶像吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_j:cmd-000213:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e707e9105d7c5d8f293c99c2402daa750744644d20c7396eb15d2b2fc004a5d8",
      "text": "聊了些什么呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_j:cmd-000216:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:baad78aa444e4a6f5460ba12bfae8d041fd79912ef5037b1d56c8b20173c7947",
      "text": "嗯，与其说是聊，倒不如说是\n被问了“你们也要参加男极吗”。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_j:cmd-000218:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6b4313b2f7cd1f8aeffe74f33f6da83458978d2dd3c11f2192c8d658fd564c89",
      "text": "啊，就是那个！\n结果“男极”到底是什么玩意儿呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_j:cmd-000220:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:584b40d22cc6f19e2c909650646cb7bae4ac70d5dad7e44f54564db75c29df29",
      "text": "来搭话的那个偶像，\n感觉也带着一股非比寻常的气场。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_j:cmd-000222:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:03491ea1e15c596428709ad55f075eb66b634269456361f35fa9e3ca58ca8e5a",
      "text": "可是，那人只管自己说了就不知道走哪去了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_j:cmd-000224:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f15ef87191f865c867e0e7788ce3a3c0f9d178ceb06a79275be3ee43f229ae0c",
      "text": "说起来，北斗君他们在休息室\n好像也说发现了信来着……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_j:cmd-000226:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6e7a9188e8f991903f85875b535d6962048d876455f7f57c7e86ce29b5b5f86d",
      "text": "难道跟那个有什么关系……等等，我还在跟监督通电话呢！\n对不起！总而言之今天辛苦啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_j:cmd-000228:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:935fa7c08b3b10986c9fbf2b1d86ca1396e2c5d02327dc585291a75fbc48a337",
      "text": "关于男极的事，要是知道些什么了请告诉我们哦。\n那么，明天开始也请多关照啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_j:cmd-000230:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:036572399844090363903e6c84340d4b082066cea5e407bd785498e2ac979ae3",
      "text": "●●●●●●●●●●监督，\n好好休息哦！回见！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_j:cmd-000237:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fb9fddea0f3c75219b2e04fb5d525253140b59715edd9b83bb792b1c5be5da29",
      "text": "第1章　迈出步伐，向着闪耀的舞台　完",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
